<title>CHINA: Glorious Sun declares 1st final results.</title>
<headline>Glorious Sun declares 1st final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   21.92</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    6.3</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  13.25 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    194.43</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,381.42</p>
<p>    Company name		 Glorious Sun Enterprises Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  August 11-14</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   August 28</p>
<p>NOTE - Casual wear maker and retailer Glorious Sun was listed on the Stock Exchange on September 17, 1996.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain representing interest income on subscription money received upon issuance of new shares for listing on the Stock Exchange in September 1996.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 6.3 H.K. cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
